{"title":"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Abby, Bret, Carl, and Dana are seated in a row of four seats numbered <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/5/925e91f2179a6f30cd52def3824c0391ce6472ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\#1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/2/162f83580ee29c982f2730580bc839d8eb4901fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\#4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"24\" height=\"15\" />.  Joe looks at them and says:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/c/3cca0cd3fcd3620a8752c1c6892f4e5f61060862.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\hspace{2em}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"2\" />\"Bret is next to Carl.\"\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/c/3cca0cd3fcd3620a8752c1c6892f4e5f61060862.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\hspace{2em}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"2\" />\"Abby is between Bret and Carl.\"\n</p><p>However each one of Joe's statements is false.  Bret is actually sitting in seat <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/1/3f1a2d639cd8c9153b16d4b8753c87b7088baf60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\#3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"23\" height=\"16\" />.  Who is sitting in seat <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/a/50a3fce09f255c10f3ac2baf26960532b59423d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\#2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/9/1995358484652b2f944d2412f48f00c8e4a830e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\text{Abby} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\text{Bret} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\text{Carl} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\text{Dana} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\text{There is not enough information to be sure.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"744\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Bret sits in seat <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/1/3f1a2d639cd8c9153b16d4b8753c87b7088baf60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\#3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"23\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/2/322aca9b6a8782b19e8b499e7e4e0ec08cf6074a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{-----}\\qquad \\text{-----} \\qquad \\textbf{Bret} \\qquad \\text{-----}\\]\" width=\"212\" height=\"11\" />\n</p><p>Since Carl is not next to Bret, he sits in seat <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/5/925e91f2179a6f30cd52def3824c0391ce6472ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\#1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/8/b68aebb026d7bc8b86a0dec26b01f2bc5b9abd6d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\textbf{Carl}\\qquad \\text{-----} \\qquad \\text{Bret} \\qquad \\text{-----}\\]\" width=\"217\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Since Abby is not between Bret and Carl, she sits in seat <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/2/162f83580ee29c982f2730580bc839d8eb4901fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\#4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"24\" height=\"15\" />.  \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/b/e4b098bbee43552711c399cd7b2d3fcb7dd66004.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Carl}\\qquad \\text{-----} \\qquad \\text{Bret} \\qquad \\textbf{Abby}\\]\" width=\"232\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>This leaves <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/4/b3438bbbce85e6b09010f5554d6d653b4b3d458b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{Dana}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"87\" height=\"30\" /> to sit in seat <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/a/50a3fce09f255c10f3ac2baf26960532b59423d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\#2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/0/2b006bf647c9ddc1808dc1b07b407d036b4cc96d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Carl}\\qquad \\textbf{Dana} \\qquad \\text{Bret} \\qquad \\text{Abby}\\]\" width=\"245\" height=\"15\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME\" title=\"1987 AJHSME\">1987 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Pro